+        {"key": "catalog", "label": "Fact catalog", "enabled": True, "used": 1170, "limit": 3000,
+         "unit": "estimated tokens", "listed": 54, "eligible": 56}]}
+```
+
+`usage_report` feeds `layers.provider` of `GET /api/memory`.
